From 642770e582db24a22363b153b9bee6680f3f4b7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 08:21:45 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: the Reloaded engine rules, level-up, ailments and
 damage (ARENA_RULES_*)

The first engine rules of the Golden Sun Reloaded rebalance, written again in C from
its patch, each behind a switch that defaults to off until the data they are tuned
with has been ported:
- ARENA_RULES_LEVELUP: a level-up gains a fixed amount (no random part).
- ARENA_RULES_AILMENTS: the effect success roll, with base chance tables chosen by
  the target's luck (bosses at 40 and up are immune to most ailments) and the
  caster's Ailment attribute.
- ARENA_RULES_DAMAGE: base power grows with the caster's max PP, summons add a
  smaller share of the target's HP, a party member's class ward scales the damage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
